<v Jeremy  Shamos>布莱恩走近，在我身边跪下。他通过手机使用Andros（我的语言）与我交流。通常，他在打完每一行字后都会看着我的眼睛。今天，他只是看着手机。他说：“你有了一个新任务。”我不喜欢这个。他解释道。

00:47:57.260 --> 00:48:29.640
<v Jeremy  Shamos>The new job is based on a completely new idea. The old idea was nobody gets hurt. The new idea is nobody plus one gets hurt. The new idea is a person can be considered unsecured ordinance and eligible for detonation. Specifically, Mr. Owen Jackson, 36, who murdered a police officer can be considered unsecured ordinance and eligible for detonation.
<v Jeremy  Shamos>新任务基于一个全新的想法。旧想法是没人受伤。新想法是没人加一人受伤。新想法是人可以被视为未固定军械并符合引爆条件。具体来说，谋杀了警官的36岁的欧文·杰克逊先生可以被视为未固定军械并符合引爆条件。

00:48:29.640 --> 00:48:55.300
<v Jeremy  Shamos>It takes me 53 seconds to understand the new idea. That's a long time for my kind. I think I mentioned before how much I like my job because it's simple, because I come between the unsecured ordinance and the people, because there are three scenarios, and people get hurt in none of them.
